    "lines": [
      "Best weekend of the season at Scheels. Tulsa beat Lou Fusz White 5-1 on Saturday, then drew 1-1 with Lou Fusz Gold on Sunday. Both are posted on GotSport.",
      "Gold came in 6-0-1 and had just put eight past Oklahoma Celtic the day before, so a point off them is the standout result so far.",
      "Tulsa holds 6th of 11 at 3-4-1, 1.25 points per game, 13 scored and 12 conceded, goal difference +1.",
      "That draw cost Gold top spot. HTX beat Dallas Surf 4-1 on Sunday and moved to 1st on 2.75 points per game, with Gold 2nd. Surf stayed 5th but fell to -3 goal difference.",
